# Initial thermal radiofrequency ablation of facet joint nerves (64633-64636), from Medicare LCD L38773 (CGS). Status
# draft: awaiting clinical sign-off (vaglio signoff). Every clause is quoted from library/sources/L38773-facet.txt.
#
# Drafted by hand. The LCD's four criteria for every facet intervention, then the initial-RFA criterion: two diagnostic
# medial branch blocks, each with at least 80% relief. The blocks are found in the record as two facet injections
# (64490-64495) on different days in the last year, or answered; the relief cannot be read from a Procedure, so it is a
# question of its own, and two blocks without it prove nothing. The frequency limit (two RFA sessions per region per
# rolling 12 months) is a count of RFA procedures (64633, 64635) on different days in the last 365 days: two already
# done denies a third. The record cannot tell spinal regions apart, so two in different regions also count; the
# clinician should decide whether to keep it. Repeat RFA, therapeutic injections and cyst aspiration are other
# policies.
policy facet_rfa
  title "Facet joint radiofrequency ablation (64633-64636), initial"
  version 0.1.0
  source "Medicare LCD L38773, Facet Joint Interventions for Pain Management (CGS), indications C and limitations"
  status draft
  questionnaire https://vaglio.example/Questionnaire/facet-rfa
  service cpt 64633 64634 64635 64636

evidence axial_pain
  text "Moderate to severe chronic axial neck or low back pain causing a measured functional deficit"
  clause "Moderate to severe chronic neck or low back pain, predominantly axial, that causes functional deficit measured on pain or disability scale*"
  find question axial-pain

evidence conservative_failed
  text "Pain for at least 3 months, with documented failure of noninvasive conservative management"
  clause "Pain present for minimum of 3 months with documented failure to respond to noninvasive conservative management (as tolerated)"
  find question conservative-failed
  request document loinc 11506-3

evidence untreated_radiculopathy
  text "Untreated radiculopathy or neurogenic claudication"
  clause "Absence of untreated radiculopathy or neurogenic claudication (except for radiculopathy caused by facet joint synovial cyst)"
  find question untreated-radiculopathy

evidence non_facet_pathology
  text "Non-facet pathology that could explain the pain"
  clause "There is no non-facet pathology per clinical assessment or radiology studies that could explain the source of the patient’s pain, including but not limited to fracture, tumor, infection, or significant deformity."
  find question non-facet-pathology

evidence two_diagnostic_blocks
  text "Two diagnostic medial branch blocks"
  clause "Initial thermal radiofrequency destruction after the patient has had at least two (2) medically reasonable and necessary diagnostic MBBs, with each one providing a consistent minimum of 80% sustained relief of primary (index) pain (with the duration of relief being consistent with the agent used)"
  find question two-diagnostic-blocks
  find procedure cpt 64490 64491 64492 64493 64494 64495 within 365 days times 2

evidence blocks_80_percent
  text "Each diagnostic block gave at least 80% relief of the index pain"
  clause "Initial thermal radiofrequency destruction after the patient has had at least two (2) medically reasonable and necessary diagnostic MBBs, with each one providing a consistent minimum of 80% sustained relief of primary (index) pain (with the duration of relief being consistent with the agent used)"
  find question blocks-80-percent
  request document loinc 28570-0

evidence two_rfa_this_year
  text "Two radiofrequency sessions already in the last 12 months"
  clause "Frequency Limitation: For each covered spinal region, no more than two (2) radiofrequency sessions will be reimbursed per rolling 12 months."
  find question two-rfa-this-year
  find procedure cpt 64633 64635 within 365 days times 2

criterion no_axial_pain
  text "Moderate to severe axial pain with a measured functional deficit is not documented."
  clause "Moderate to severe chronic neck or low back pain, predominantly axial, that causes functional deficit measured on pain or disability scale*"
  defeated by axial_pain

criterion conservative_unestablished
  text "Three months of pain with failed conservative management is not documented."
  clause "Pain present for minimum of 3 months with documented failure to respond to noninvasive conservative management (as tolerated)"
  defeated by conservative_failed

criterion blocks_unestablished
  text "Two diagnostic blocks, each with at least 80% relief, are not documented."
  clause "Initial thermal radiofrequency destruction after the patient has had at least two (2) medically reasonable and necessary diagnostic MBBs, with each one providing a consistent minimum of 80% sustained relief of primary (index) pain (with the duration of relief being consistent with the agent used)"
  defeated by blocks_qualify

criterion no_blocks
  text "Two diagnostic blocks are not documented."
  clause "Initial thermal radiofrequency destruction after the patient has had at least two (2) medically reasonable and necessary diagnostic MBBs, with each one providing a consistent minimum of 80% sustained relief of primary (index) pain (with the duration of relief being consistent with the agent used)"
  defeated by two_diagnostic_blocks

criterion no_relief
  text "At least 80% relief from each block is not documented."
  clause "Initial thermal radiofrequency destruction after the patient has had at least two (2) medically reasonable and necessary diagnostic MBBs, with each one providing a consistent minimum of 80% sustained relief of primary (index) pain (with the duration of relief being consistent with the agent used)"
  defeated by blocks_80_percent

criterion blocks_qualify
  text "Two diagnostic blocks, each with at least 80% relief."
  clause "Initial thermal radiofrequency destruction after the patient has had at least two (2) medically reasonable and necessary diagnostic MBBs, with each one providing a consistent minimum of 80% sustained relief of primary (index) pain (with the duration of relief being consistent with the agent used)"
  defeated by no_blocks no_relief

criterion no_exclusion_shown
  text "No untreated radiculopathy, no non-facet pathology, and fewer than two RFA sessions in the last 12 months."
  clause "Facet Joint Interventions are considered medically reasonable and necessary for the diagnosis and treatment of chronic pain in patients who meet ALL the following criteria:"
  defeated by untreated_radiculopathy non_facet_pathology two_rfa_this_year

decision approve approves
  text "Approve the radiofrequency ablation."
  clause "The thermal radiofrequency destruction of cervical, thoracic, or lumbar paravertebral facet joint (medial branch) nerves are considered medically reasonable and necessary for patients who meet the following criteria:"
  defeated by no_axial_pain conservative_unestablished blocks_unestablished untreated_radiculopathy non_facet_pathology two_rfa_this_year

decision deny_criteria denies
  text "Deny: the pain, conservative-management or diagnostic-block criteria are not met."
  clause "Facet Joint Interventions are considered medically reasonable and necessary for the diagnosis and treatment of chronic pain in patients who meet ALL the following criteria:"
  defeated by criteria_met

criterion criteria_met
  text "The pain, conservative-management and diagnostic-block criteria are met."
  clause "Facet Joint Interventions are considered medically reasonable and necessary for the diagnosis and treatment of chronic pain in patients who meet ALL the following criteria:"
  defeated by no_axial_pain conservative_unestablished blocks_unestablished

decision deny_excluded denies
  text "Deny: untreated radiculopathy, non-facet pathology, or two RFA sessions already in the last 12 months."
  clause "Frequency Limitation: For each covered spinal region, no more than two (2) radiofrequency sessions will be reimbursed per rolling 12 months."
  defeated by no_exclusion_shown
